      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TO DO List\n\n1. Delete All buffer attribution system from manager and cluster and chunk\n2. Splitting Generation process in subclass for better readability and Modification.\n3. Generation workflow modification. (Attribution of buffers only when chunk fully generated.)\n4. Creation of new buffer system.\n5. Attribution of buffer manager rework (Creation at start, deletion when unused Since long time, request on demand (promise system ?))",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TO DO List\n\n1. Delete All buffer attribution system from manager and cluster and chunk\n2. Splitting Generation process in subclass for better readability and Modification.\n3. Generation workflow modification. (Attribution of buffers only when chunk fully generated.)\n4. Creation of new buffer system.\n5. Attribution of buffer manager rework (Creation at start, deletion when unused Since long time, request on demand (promise system ?))",
